  "content": "\n\n<h1>攻擊速度附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fattack-speed-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/attack-speed-enchantment?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"授權\"></a></p>\n<p>攻擊速度是一種全新的劍類附魔，共有三個等級，能夠提升您的攻擊速度！</p>\n<p>此附魔可透過附魔台、戰利品箱或與村民交易獲得。</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot attack_speed_enchantment:&lt;level&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s attack_speed_enchantment:attack_speed &lt;level&gt;</code></pre>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤與問題</h2>\n<p>請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題、錯誤或缺陷。</p>\n<h2>💌 贊助</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">前往 Ko-Fi 贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">前往 PayPal 贊助</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器託管</h2>\n<p>自行架設伺服器可能是一個非常耗時、繁瑣且成本高昂的過程。</p>\n<p>但使用 BisectHosting，只需幾下點擊即可擁有專屬伺服器！他們提供全天候客服支援與快速回應，確保您的使用體驗順暢無阻！有興趣嗎？我們為您準備了專屬優惠！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-302